script = ExtResource("1_1ep6a")
description = "All true ponygirls are cursed with a magical womb tattoo - a symbol placed on the lower belly, directly above the crotch. It usually resembles a cross between a heart and a womb, which is likely where its name originates.
The curse is placed by the tribe’s or warband’s shaman. The tattoo glows in response to the ponygirl’s arousal, and her owner can use command phrases to magically increase her desire, such as “Get eager,” or suppress it with commands such as “Easy, calm down.” A suitable command can also trigger an immediate and intense climax, for example: “Cum now!”
The tattoo also prevents the ponygirl from reaching orgasm without explicit permission, usually given through phrases such as “You may cum” or “You may orgasm now.”
Through the womb tattoo, a ponygirl’s arousal can be controlled completely. She can be kept on the very edge of orgasm for hours without ever achieving release. This is sometimes employed as a ritual punishment for particularly rebellious ponygirls.
Curiously, every known goblin tribe possesses knowledge of this curse, suggesting that its magic may be somehow innate to goblinkind. At present, only the most powerful anti-magic can remove it. Most freed ponygirls therefore retain their tattoos for the rest of their lives, often allowing their partners to become their new “owners” and assume control over the tattoos magic.
In at least one documented case where a womb tattoo could not be applied, the goblins used a set of cursed jewellery to produce a similar effect (consisting of nipple and clitoral piercings).

— Excerpt from “Ponygirls of the Borderlands: An Essay on Goblins and Their Mounts,” by Scholar Lula of Trisa Academy"
